      <p>Thank you for writing to Imizi Links. Your message has reached us and a member of the community will take care of it.</p>
      <p><strong>For a support request,</strong> a local contact in your city will reply within 48 working hours.<br>
      <strong>For an event registration,</strong> we will confirm your place by reply.<br>
      <strong>For a job application,</strong> we will check your application and pass it on to the company within 72 hours.<br>
      <strong>For a partnership request,</strong> we will get back to you within 72 hours to arrange a call.</p>
      <p>If you do not hear from us, please check your spam folder.</p>
